TITLE:Workshop Spec
H1:M10 · The workshop and tinkering (from Day 12; tinkering from Day 6) <span class="draft">Step 4 · draft for review</span>
SUB:Crew order small things at the machine shop; you make them and hand them over. Off shift you tinker for gifts or your cabin. Step 4, sub-block 24j. Plan Part 2, M10 and "Off shift".
NAV:plain=In plain words|grow=How it grows|b=Builder|tests=Tests|ranges=Seat and size|faq=FAQ

<section id="plain">
  <h2>In plain words</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><b>The order board</b> in Deck 5's machine shop gets one or two orders a week (posted Mondays 08:00) from crew you know: "A hook for my guitar, please. Pell." Each order names a thing and a person.</li>
    <li><b>Make it:</b> take the order (tap the board), then at the lathe or the fabricator a <code>wait</code> (10 ship minutes) and a short <code>hold</code> to finish. The thing goes into a hand.</li>
    <li><b>Hand it over</b> in person (tap them): a thank-you line and a friendship step. An order you never take lapses after 7 days ("I made do, don't worry"): no harm.</li>
    <li><b>Tinkering</b> (from Day 6, off shift): at the same machines, make one thing from a short list (a lamp, a mug rack, a toy rocket, a plant pot) for a gift (Pillar 4's gifts) or for your cabin (cabin touches). Scrap is free; one at a time.</li>
    <li><b>Who:</b> the machine shop tech on shift teaches the first order (a by-list, first on shift). <b>You get:</b> Works reputation +1 per order handed over (at most one a day), a friendship step, and leisure while tinkering.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section id="grow">
  <h2>How it grows</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card"><b>Stage 1 · Simple orders</b><span>Day 12 on.</span></div>
    <div class="card"><b>Stage 2 · A part from stores</b><span>After 3 orders: some need a part fetched from a storage shelf first (M4's carry).</span></div>
    <div class="card"><b>Stage 3 · Your own designs</b><span>After 6 orders: two more things on the tinkering list.</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="b" class="builder">
  <h2>For the builder</h2>
  <p class="note">One owner per function: the seat in the last column builds it; everyone else calls it, one line, typeof-guarded, listed in DEV_NOTES' hook register.</p>
  <div class="tablewrap"><table>
    <tr><th>Section</th><th>What</th><th>Owner</th></tr>
    <tr><td>24j (new)</td><td><code>WORKSHOP_ORDERS</code> (data: thing, who can ask, which machine), <code>shopOrderPost(week)</code>, take, make, hand over, lapse; the tinkering list</td><td>E3 (M3's seat)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>15</td><td><code>wait</code> and <code>hold</code> steps (exist); the made thing in a hand (<code>carry</code>, exists)</td><td>P (exists, no change)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Pillar 4 gifts</td><td>a made thing given as a gift: <code>typeof giftGive === 'function' &amp;&amp; giftGive(id, item)</code></td><td>social (exists)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>DECKS[5]</td><td>places <code>5-shop-board</code>, <code>5-shop-lathe</code>, <code>5-shop-fab</code></td><td>E3 (the Step 4 places turn)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>content/</td><td>order lines and thank-yous (<code>works.order.*</code>)</td><td>writer</td></tr>
  </table></div>
  <ul>
    <li><b>Data:</b> <code>SHIP.works.side.shop = { orders: [{ id, who, what, day, state }], made: n, tinkered: [ids] }</code>. Saved under <code>SHIP.works.side</code>; read defensively (a missing field is the default), so old saves load.</li>
    <li><b>Who orders:</b> crew at friendship "acquainted" or better, picked with <code>schedU(week, 0, 1010)</code>; the thing with <code>schedU(week, 1, 1011)</code>. The lathe and fabricator are places here, not wearing machines (simplest; wear can come later).</li>
    <li><b>Phone:</b> made things are small props from the existing kit, drawn only where placed (1 draw call each; the cabin cap is 4).</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section id="tests" class="builder">
  <h2>Tests</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><code>mech_check</code> (24j): an order posted, taken, made, handed over; the friendship step; a lapse does no harm; tinkering one at a time; a gift reaches the gifts system; the same twice.</li>
    <li><code>interactions_check</code>: the board, lathe and fabricator are usable places.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section id="ranges" class="builder">
  <h2>Seat and size</h2>
  <ul><li>Seat <b>E3</b> (M3's seat, <code>claude/mech-diagnose</code>, 0.53.x). <b>Build size: M.</b> Hash keys from the second range (1010-1049; 1000-1004 are H2's, checked 2026-10-19): <b>1010-1011</b> (who, what).</li></ul>
</section>

<section id="faq">
  <h2>Builders' questions</h2>
